    <itunes:duration>00:47:35</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu53TlWG5ST56uK7l6_FZKmXXNSs.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>56 细说情绪与进食：营养师x精神科医生x亲历者故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69a6a0d6a22480add6cd7fd2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69a6a0d6a22480add6cd7fd2</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Mar 2026 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>加入我们的大圆桌讨论会！来听过来人和专业人士的宝贵经验交流。</span></p><p><span>本期节目是听友群内发起的</span><strong><em><span>【第一期线上茶话会】</span></em></strong><span>录音。为了更好地形成交流氛围，解决群友的高频疑问，“茶话会”终于在</span><strong><span>空井3周年前夕</span></strong><span>悄然举行啦！</span></p><p><span>本次的主题聚焦在大家最在乎的</span><strong><span>“体重管理”</span></strong><span>，参加者有精神心理问题、1型糖尿病的亲历者，也有心理治疗学生、精神科医生和注册营养师。希望大家能从这次对话中有所收获！</span></p><p><em><span>Trigger warning：如果正在经历进食、清除问题并对相关话题有负面情绪体验请谨慎点开。</span></em></p><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>Part1｜分享者故事环节</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">1:00</a> 前言和专家嘉宾介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="271">4:31</a> 【点点】待业、抑郁和情绪化进食</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="641">10:41</a> 【白羊】大学生活与不规律进食</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="907">15:07</a> 如何规律去吃？女性的食欲和维生素D摄入</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1171">19:31</a>【Annie】精神科药物与BMI</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a>【穆文】两次截然不同的进食障碍住院体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1701">28:21</a> 目前公立医院中对进食障碍治疗的局限性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1904">31:44</a>【星】肉肉的，但是有力量</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2172">36:12</a> （脑肠轴）肠道菌群与情绪调节</span></p><p><strong><span>Part2｜营养师 x 精神科医生专家小讲课</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2447">40:47</a> 精神科药物的体重增加副作用</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2596">43:16</a> 饮食结构：膳食宝塔和圆盘模型</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2777">46:17</a> “高营养密度”食物？加工食物？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2935">48:55</a> 进食障碍的饮食管理</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3117">51:57</a> 直觉饮食intuative：正视身体的信号</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3538">58:58</a> 调节食欲的“改变环境”法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3634">60:34</a> 进食障碍不为人知的病因：家庭关系与权力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3751">62:31</a> 一些心理调节的小tips</span></p><p><strong><span>Part3｜互动提问环节</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3978">66:18</a> 如何看待现在流行的身材判定标准</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4345">72:25</a> 怎么戒奶茶！饮水量的调节</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4655">77:35</a> 如何在药物的疗效（改善情绪）和副作用（体重增加）之间找到平衡？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4853">80:53</a> 【小F】我和我的1型糖尿病//血糖控制与焦虑情绪安抚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5526">92:06</a> 结语：获得自己的支持体系</span></p><p><strong><span>进食相关既往单集推荐：</span></strong></p><p><span>亲历者采访</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6484216be68894365dd45b64" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6484216be68894365dd45b64"><span>5 进食障碍对谈 | 漫画腿、A4腰，我与体重的斗争史</span></a></p><p><span>专家采访</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/648e8209830480fdfa290b48" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/648e8209830480fdfa290b48"><span>6 我们与病的距离：暴食厌食没有绝对诱因</span></a></p><p><span>【ED healer创始人，博主：少女神婆婆采访】上集聚焦在她作为科普博主+亲历者的经历</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65ef1c758e6f71a5b7605f50" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65ef1c758e6f71a5b7605f50"><span>27 ICU、热搜和艺术展览：进食障碍博主“少女神婆婆”（上）</span></a></p><p><span>下集聚焦在EDhealer亲历者组织的发展历程</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65ef1ccd8e6f71a5b7606b63" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65ef1ccd8e6f71a5b7606b63"><span>28 发展进食障碍组织：年轻的我们能做的事｜对话EDhealer创始人（下）</span></a></p><p><span>音频制作：小井+夏虫</span></p><p><span>配乐：莫非定律乐队-Bella vita</span></p><p><span>听友群：kongjing_0310</span></p>]]></description>
